# DES(Data Encryption Standard) Algorithm

DES is a symmetric-key block cipher that uses the same secret key for encryption and decryption.

# Implementation
Language: Java
Algorithm: DES
Mode: ECB
Padding: PKCS5Padding
Key: Generated using Java KeyGenerator
Operation: Encryption and Decryption

The program encrypts a sample message using a randomly generated DES key and then decrypts the ciphertext using the same key to recover the original message.
